-- (9B)(d): not later than the business day next following the day when the resolution in (a) is passed, the company sends to each member having the right to vote on the resolution in (e)
-- a notice containing particulars of (i) the directors' resolution; (ii) the class and number of shares or units of shares; (iii) the consideration payable; (iv) the identity of the person receiving
-- the assistance and, if not the beneficial owner, of the beneficial owner; (v) the nature and, if quantifiable, the amount of the assistance; (vi) such further information and explanation as may be
-- necessary to enable a reasonable member to understand the nature and implications for the company and its members of the proposed transaction.
