      `the notice gives the identity of the person receiving the financial assistance and, if that person is not the beneficial owner, the identity of the beneficial owner` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the notice gives the nature and, if quantifiable, the amount of the financial assistance` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the notice gives such further information and explanation as may be necessary to enable a reasonable member to understand the nature and implications for the company and its members of the proposed transaction` IS A BOOLEAN
