GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 76(9BA)(c) the resolution sets out the grounds` MEANS
    IF `the resolution sets out in full the grounds for the directors' conclusions`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "if ... (c) the resolution sets out in full the grounds for the directors' conclusions" -- a condition introduced by "if", unmet

