§ `Section 76(9D): directors' duties are not relieved`

-- (9D): a director is not relieved of any duty to the company under section 157 or otherwise, whether of a fiduciary nature or not, in connection with the giving of financial assistance, by
-- (a) the passing of a resolution by the board under (9A) or (9BA); or (b) the passing of a resolution by the board and of a resolution by the members under (9B).
-- src:7797 | (9D) A director of a company is not relieved of any duty to the
-- src:7798 | company under section 157 or otherwise, and whether of a fiduciary
-- src:7799 | nature or not, in connection with the giving of financial assistance by
-- src:7800 | the company for the purpose of, or in connection with, an acquisition
-- src:7801 | or proposed acquisition of shares or units of shares in the company or
-- src:7802 | in a holding company or ultimate holding company (as the case may
-- src:7803 | be) of the company, by —
-- src:7805 | (a) the passing of a resolution by the board of directors of the
-- src:7806 | company under subsection (9A) or (9BA) for the giving of
-- src:7807 | the financial assistance; or
-- src:7809 | (b) the passing of a resolution by the board of directors of the
-- src:7810 | company, and the passing of a resolution by the members
-- src:7811 | of the company, under subsection (9B) for the giving of the
-- src:7812 | financial assistance.
@ref s 76(9D) (src:7797-7812)
GIVEN `the board of directors has passed a resolution under subsection (9A) or (9BA) for the giving of the financial assistance` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the board of directors and the members have each passed a resolution under subsection (9B) for the giving of the financial assistance` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 76(9D) the director is relieved of the director's duty to the company by the resolution` MEANS
    IF    `the board of directors has passed a resolution under subsection (9A) or (9BA) for the giving of the financial assistance`
       OR `the board of directors and the members have each passed a resolution under subsection (9B) for the giving of the financial assistance`
    THEN JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "A director of a company is not relieved of any duty to the company under section 157 or otherwise, and whether of a fiduciary nature or not" (a flat negative, ruling N2 of 2026-11-04)
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the subsection speaks of relief "by" those resolutions and says nothing of relief by any other means
